<group data_src="">
<item type="1">
<value>AD_Adjust</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：电子尺调整

1.归零设定：射出、开关模、托模及压力传感器在零位时（射出到底、关模到底、托模退到底、系统压力为0），而当前位置显示不为零，则在归零设置选择确定进行归零。

2.调整位置：射出、开关模及托模在最大位置时（射退到底、开模到底、托模进到底），用圈尺测量机构到零点的距离，将测量值输入对应的‘调整位置’框，当前位置变为测量值时，完成调整。

3.把每个动作在最大位置测量到的数值，即最大机械行程，减去2～5mm后输入到机器配置页面的机械行程栏内。此步骤是限制了动作终止位置输入上限，以防止机械撞击。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Machine AD Adjust

1.Reset: When the screw, mold, ejector and pressure sensor are reset (clamp is fully closed, full injection, ejector returns completely, and system pressure is 0), and the current position is not reset, choose Reset and press ENT to reset the position.

2.ADJ Pos: When the screw, mold and ejector are at the maximum position (clamp is fully open, suck-back completely, fully ejected), measure the distance between the mechanism and the reset position. Enter the value into the corresponding 'ADJ Pos'. The adjustment is completed when the current position reaches the measured value.

3.Deduct 2-5 mm from the maximum mechanical stroke of each movement and enter the value into the mechanical stroke column on the machine configuration page. This limits the end position of each movement and prevents mechanical parts from colliding with each other.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>AD_Zero</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：电子尺归零

1.归零设定：射出、开关模、托模及压力传感器在零位时（射出到底、关模到底、托模退到底、系统压力为0），而当前位置显示不为零，则在归零设置选择确定进行归零。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
