<item type="1">
<value>Alarm_Para</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：警报参数

1.自动警报启动模数：
1.1此参数设定为0或自动警报选择不使用，不启动自动警报，并且用本页面作为警报参数；
1.2此参数设定不为0且自动警报选择使用，到达设定模数后，启用自动警报；

2.关模低压计时警报上限：关模低压计时的警报上限；

3.关模高压计时警报上限：关模高压计时的警报上限。

4.储料计时警报上限：储料动作的总时间，超过此设定时间即报警“储料未定时完成”；

5.射退计时警报上限：射退动作的总时间，超过此设定时间即报警“射退终未到定位”；

6.料管温度上下限警报值：料管实际温度值与料管设定温度值差值大于此上限设定值，则报“温度偏差”故障；料管设定温度值与料管实际温度值差值大于此下限警报值，则报“温度偏差”；

7.开关模计时警报上限：在配置中CODE0包含40时，启用开关模计时警报，在设定的时间内未到达开关模终止位置，则报警“开模未到定位”或“关模未到定位”；

8.“警报切电热时间”与“蜂鸣器警报次数”关联使用，当报警时蜂鸣器闪烁次数达到警报次数后，切马达，马达关闭之后，延时“警报切电热时间”后，电热关闭；</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">1</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">1</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Warn Para

1.Auto Alarm On Cycle Number: 
1.1When the value is 0, auto alarm is disabled and alarm parameters are set to values on this page;
1.2When it is not 0, auto alarm will be enabled when the preset cycle number is reached;

2.Closing Low Pressure Alarm Time: maximum time of the clamp closing process in low pressure before alarm;

3.Closing High Pressure Alarm Time: maximum time of the clamp closing process in high pressure before alarm;

4.Charging Alarm Time: It is the total time of the charging process. The alarm "Fail to Complete Charging in Time" will be made when the time expires;

5.Suck Back Alarm Time: It is the total time of the suck-back process. The alarm "Fail to Suck Back" will be made when the time expires;

6.Max and Min Alarming Tube Temp: When the difference between the actual temperature of the charging tube and the preset temperature is larger than the maximum or minimum value, the system prompts "Temperature Error";

7.Max Alarming Clamp Opening/Closing Time: When CODE0 includes 40 in configuration and clamp opening/closing alarm is enabled, the alarm "Clamp Opening Failure" or "Clamp Closing Failure" will be made when the clamp opening or closing process is not completed within the preset time;

8."Heater Off Time" and "Buzzer Count": When the number of times that the buzzer flickers reaches the preset value that triggers the alarm, the motor will be turned off and the heater will be turned off too after the "Heater Off Time" expires;</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">1</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">1</string>
