</item>
<item type="1">
<value>DA_Adjust</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：机器调整DA

机器调整DA步骤：

1.DA线性调整：机器类型为普通机时，须进行压力、流量DA调整。

2.DA选择：共四组，第一组对应P、F通道，默认为系统压力、流量；第二组对应Pre2端口，一般选为储料背压；第三、四组对应扩展板的DA通道。

3.启动马达，选择DA压力调整：

3.1 设定起流，一般为30%；
3.2 压力调零，选中调整按输入变调整中后，按面板上下键调整，直至压力表或对应的电流表指向零位。
3.3 最大压力，操作同上，直至压力表稳定在系统最大压力。

3.4 线性调整，第一种方法，把压力表显示压力输入相应的压力Bar栏；第二种方法更改输出值直至压力表显示与Bar值相等。调整完毕，保存确认。

4.选择DA流量调整：操作方法同第3步。但需通过计算螺杆转速确认流量的大小，故需选中左侧的“流量调整时输出储料动作”；设定并开启加热，待料筒温度达到一定温度（200度左右）才可进行流量调整。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Machine DA Adjust

DA Linear ADJ: When the machine is an ordinary machine, you need to perform pressure and flow DC adjustment

1.DA Selection: There are three groups. The first group corresponds with channel P and F. By default, it is the system pressure and flow; The second group corresponds with port Pre2 and is generally the charge back pressure; The third group corresponds with the expansion board's DA channel.

2.Start the motor and choose DA pressure adjustment

3.Set the start pressure, generally 30%;

3.1 Reset the pressure. Choose ADJ and press ENT. After it becomes In ADJ, press up and down arrows on the panel to reset the pressure or corresponding current meter.
3.2 The step of adjusting the maximum pressure is same as the fore-mentioned one. Adjust it until the pressure meter stays at the maximum pressure of the system.
3.3 The first method of linear adjustment is to enter the pressure shown on the pressure meter into the corresponding pressure Bar column. The second method is to change the input until the pressure meter's reading is same as the Bar value. Press ENT after completing adjustment.
3.4 Choose DA flow adjustment: The procedure is same as step 3. You need to calculate the flow by measuring the screw's rotate speed. Therefore, you need to select “Output Charge In Flow ADJ” on the left side; Set and enable heating. Flow can be adjusted only when the barrel reaches about 200 centigrade</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
