<item type="1">
<value>Data_Operation</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：数据操作

1.工作参数导入导出：当模具换到另一台注塑机或更换面板时使用。

2.该页面备份的是：面板基本设置，机器参数，当前模具参数，泵浦配置参数，DA比例阀线性参数。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Data Operation

1.Import/Export Work Parameters: The function is used when a mold needs to be used on another IMM or the panel needs to be replaced.

2.On this page, you can make backup copies of: basic panel settings, machine parameters, current mold parameters, pump configuration parameters and DA proportional valve's linear parameters.</string>
