<item type="1">
<value>Eject</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：托模吹气设定

1.延时：表示自开模动作开始后多久才托模/吹气。即延时计时到达，托模/吹气动作开始。托模/吹气长短由动作计时栏控制。

2.吹气设定：

2.1吹气方式4种：开模时间、位置，射出时间、位置；
2.2动作时间：即吹气阀输出时间；

2.3延时：当吹气方式选择为开模、射出时间，开模、射出后，经过延时后输出吹气；

2.4动作位置：当吹气方式选择为开模、射出位置，到达此设定位置才开始输出吹气。

3.首次独立行程：托模定次时，首次托模进采用独立行程控制，行程在“首次位置”设置；

4.吹气按键选择：选择相应的吹气组，则按下面板上的吹气按键会对相应的吹气组进行操作</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">winodow name：Eject

1.Delay: delay in actions by the pressure, flow and direction valves;


2.Air blow setting：

2.There are four air blow modes: clamp opening time/position, injection time/position;
2.2Action time: It is the output time of the air blow valve；

2.3Delay: When the air blow mode is clamp opening/injection time, the IMM will blow after the delay upon clamp opening and injection；

2.4Action position: When the air blow mode is clamp opening/injection position, the IMM will only start blowing after the set position is reached.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Eject_Func</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：托模吹气功能

1.电眼检出选择：选择使用时为电眼自动，当电眼检测不到产品掉落，则不能关模并警报；当电眼检测一直有输入则认为产品堆满并警报；

2.半托时不切托进阀：选择为1且托模方式为停留时，才有此功能，保持托进时动作压力、流量为托模慢速调试压力、流量；

3.吹气按键选择：选择相应的吹气组，则按下面板上的吹气按键会对相应的吹气组进行操作；

4.托模终检测时间：在关模过程中，超出此设定时间未检测到托模终信号，则报警。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Eject Function

1.Electric eye detection: It can be enabled and disabled. When it is enabled, it can automatically detect products that do not fall from the mold. In this case, the clamp cannot be closed and an alarm will be made. When the electric eye detects continuous input, it indicates that the tray is full and an alarm will be made.

3.Air Blow Button: When the 2nd Group is selected, press the air blow button on the panel under the manual status to activate the 2nd group blow output.

4.Eject End Detect Time: If no ejection end signal is detected after the time expires in the clamp closing process, an alarm will be made.</string>
