</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Eject_Param</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：托模参数

1.压力、流量斜率：压力、流量加减速时间，单位（S）；

2.托模调试：调模状态时托模动作压力、流量输出；

3.托模退位置有效区：托模退终位置在此偏差范围内方允许关模；

4.托模退位置允许最大值：即“托退二段”终止位置允许设定最大值；</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Eject Para

1.Pressure/Flow Slope: It refers to the acceleration time in seconds；

2.Setup Pressure/Flow: pressure and flow outputs when the ejector works under the mold adjustment status；

3.Effective Eject Return Area: The clamp can be closed when the ejector’s return end position is within the effective area；

4.Max Eject Return Position: It refers to the maximum return end position of Eject Return #2；</string>
