<item type="1">
<value>IO_Input</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：输入点一

1.输入点的功能和状态：

1.1 每一个输入点编号的右边表示该点功能，左边的圆圈表示该点输入状态，变绿/变黑时为输入有效。

1.2 若某个点输入硬件损坏，可通过 “IO重定义”可用一个空余的点将坏的点替换掉（注意下位机相应接线的调整）。

2.A620主机配置24个输入点，A920主机配置32个输入点。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：IO In

1.Function and Status:

1.1 1.1 The function of each input is described on the right side of the number and its status is indicated by the dot on the left. When the dot turns green, the input is effective.

1.2 Where the hardware of an input is broken, you can replace the input with a spare input in "IO Redefine". Notably, you need to reconnect the IO terminal on the PLC accordingly.

2.The host of A620 has 24 inputs, while that of A920 has 32 inputs.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
