<value>IO_Input_2</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：输入点二

1.扩展输入点：加了扩展板才会显示。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window：IO In 2

1.Expansion Input: Only displayed when an expansion board is added.</string>
