<item type="1">
<value>IO_Output</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：输出点一

1.输出点的功能和状态： 1.1 每一个输出点编号的右边表示该点功能，左边的圆圈表示该点输出状态，变绿/变黑时为输出有效。

1.2 若某个点输出硬件损坏，可通过 “IO重定义”可用一个空余的点将坏的点替换掉（注意下位机相应接线的调整）。

2.A620主机配置24个输出点，A920主机配置32个输出点。

3.在手动的状态中按下输入键，光标下的点会强制输出。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：IO Out1

1.Function and Status: 1.1 The function of each output is described on the right side of the number and its status is indicated by the dot on the left. When the dot turns green, the output is effective.

1.2 Where the hardware of an output is broken, you can replace the output with a spare output in "IO Redefine". Notably, you need to reconnect the IO terminal on the PLC accordingly.

2.The host of A620 has 24 outputs, while that of A920 has 32 outputs.

3.Press ENTER in manual status. The chosen output will output compulsorily.

 </string>
