<item type="1">
<value>IO_Redefine</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：I/O重新定义

1.重定义操作：输入、输出点编号必须从首行开始依次往下使用，前面有空行则后面定义无效。输入完毕需保存后才生效。

2.输入、输出点编号：对电脑主机板上的输入、输出点编号。

3.输入、输出点定义：只有输入、输出点编号更改后，同一行的定义才会显示，并可下拉选择需要的功能。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：IO Redefine

1.Redefine: Inputs and outputs must be numbered top down. If a line is blank, the definition of all the following lines is invalid. Press Save to save the inputs.

2.Number Input and Output: Number inputs and outputs on the main board of the computer;

3.Define Input and Output: The definition of a line is only displayed after the input and output are numbered. Select the function needed from the pull-down menu. Press left and right arrows on the panel to turn to another page.</string>
