<value>Key_Test</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：面板测试

1.此功能用于面板按键和显示灯测试；当按下面板键后，画面上对应的显示颜色将发生变化，若面板上有显示灯，则该显示灯状态也发生变化；连续按“主画面”键三次可退出本画面。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Panel Test

1.This function is used to test panel buttons and indicators; When you press a panel button, the color of the corresponding box on the display will change. When there is an indicator light on the panel, the status of the light will also change; Press “Main Page” three times to exit the page.</string>
