<item type="1">
<value>Lubr</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：润滑

1.共三组润滑，润滑1、润滑2和润滑3表示三组独立的润滑系统。电脑系统默认使用润滑1。

2.润滑模式：可输入0、1或2，表示3种不同模式。

2.1 输入“0”为时间润滑方式：按“自动润滑计时”做单次润滑。

2.2 输入“1”时，压力检测继电器应装在润滑泵出口端：

润滑开始 ，“自动润滑计时”到马上检查“润滑检知”输入点。输入点无效，则警报；输入点有效，检查“自动润滑总计时”是否到达，如到了则结束润滑；如未到则继续做润滑，“自动润滑延计时”一到再次检查是否超过总计时，超过即结束；未超，开始第二次润滑循环。

2.3 输入“2”时，压力检测继电器装在润滑油路末端：润滑开始，如果“自动润滑计时”时间先到，步骤同上2.2；如果“润滑检知”先有效，检查总计时是否到，到了结束，未到就做润滑延时时间，润滑延时时间到。再次检查是否超过总计时，超过即结束，未超，开始第二次润滑循环。

3.自动润滑模数：启动自动润滑所需开模数。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Lubrication

1.There are three independent lubrication system: Lub 1, 2 and 3. Lub 1 is used by default.

2.Lub Mode: There are three lubrication modes: 1, 2 and 3.

2.1 Enter 0 to use the time lubrication mode: Single lubrication is performed according to Auto Lub Time.

2.2 To enter 1, the pressure detecting relay should be installed at the outlet of the lubrication pump: Lubrication starts, "Auto Lub Time" immediately detects the input terminal of "Lub Detect". 1 is invalid, alarm; 2 is valid, check if "Auto Lub Total Time" expires. If yes, stop lubrication. If not, continue lubrication. When "Auto Lub Delay Time" expires, check if the total time expires. If yes, stop lubrication; if not, start the second lubrication cycle.

2.3 To enter 2, the pressure detecting relay should be installed at the end of the lubricant circuit: Lubrication starts. If "Auto Lub Time" expires first, perform step 2.2; if "Lub Detect" becomes valid first, check if the total time expires. When it expires, stop lubrication. If not, continue lubrication until the lubrication delay time expires. Check if the total time expires again. If yes, stop lubrication. If not, start the second lubrication cycle

3.Auto Lub Count: It is the number of cycle counts before lubrication is started.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Lubr1</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：润滑

1.共三组润滑，润滑1、润滑2和润滑3表示三组独立的润滑系统。电脑系统默认使用润滑1。

2.润滑模式：可输入0、1或2，表示3种不同模式。

2.1 输入“0”为时间润滑方式：按“自动润滑计时”做单次润滑。

2.2 输入“1”时，压力检测继电器应装在润滑泵出口端：

润滑开始 ，“自动润滑计时”到马上检查“润滑检知”输入点。输入点无效，则警报；输入点有效，检查“自动润滑总计时”是否到达，如到了则结束润滑；如未到则继续做润滑，“自动润滑延计时”一到再次检查是否超过总计时，超过即结束；未超，开始第二次润滑循环。

2.3 输入“2”时，压力检测继电器装在润滑油路末端：润滑开始，如果“自动润滑计时”时间先到，步骤同上2.2；如果“润滑检知”先有效，检查总计时是否到，到了结束，未到就做润滑延时时间，润滑延时时间到。再次检查是否超过总计时，超过即结束，未超，开始第二次润滑循环。

3.自动润滑模数：启动自动润滑所需开模数。1</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">1</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">1</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Lubrication

1.There are three independent lubrication system: Lub 1, 2 and 3. Lub 1 is used by default.

2.Lub Mode: There are three lubrication modes: 1, 2 and 3.

2.1 Enter 0 to use the time lubrication mode: Single lubrication is performed according to Auto Lub Time.

2.2 To enter 1, the pressure detecting relay should be installed at the outlet of the lubrication pump: Lubrication starts, "Auto Lub Time" immediately detects the input terminal of "Lub Detect". 1 is invalid, alarm; 2 is valid, check if "Auto Lub Total Time" expires. If yes, stop lubrication. If not, continue lubrication. When "Auto Lub Delay Time" expires, check if the total time expires. If yes, stop lubrication; if not, start the second lubrication cycle.

2.3 To enter 2, the pressure detecting relay should be installed at the end of the lubricant circuit: Lubrication starts. If "Auto Lub Time" expires first, perform step 2.2; if "Lub Detect" becomes valid first, check if the total time expires. When it expires, stop lubrication. If not, continue lubrication until the lubrication delay time expires. Check if the total time expires again. If yes, stop lubrication. If not, start the second lubrication cycle

3.Auto Lub Count: It is the number of cycle counts before lubrication is started.1</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">1</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">1</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Mach_Cfg</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：机器配置

1.Code码：每个代码包含16种功能。每个功能代码对应的16进制数，从小开始依次是1、2、4、8、10、20、40、80、100、200、400、800、1000、2000、4000、8000。当一个Code码同时使用几个功能时，则将几个功能对应的16进制数累加起来，然后输入对应的Code框。增加功能时，也是把功能代码叠加到对应的Code框，以免删除了原来的功能。

2.机器类型：普通机和伺服机，必须正确选择。

3.储料RPM孔数：输入实际储料电眼的个数，储料画面会正常显示螺杆转速。

4.各个功能及Code码修改需先输入正确的修改密码。

5.系统压力上限：所有动作的压力都受此参数限制。

6.主机的机器配置参数备份恢复：在此页面进行写U盘，就可把机器配置代码和参数复制到U盘，然后在其他电脑上进行读U盘，把代码参数复制过去。多台相同机型调试或更换主机时使用。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Machine Config

1.Code: Each code has 16 functions. Each function code corresponds to the following hexadecimal numbers: 1, 2, 4, 8, 10, 20, 40, 80, 100, 200, 400, 800, 1000, 2000, 4000, and 8000. When one code has several functions, their hexadecimal numbers will be added and entered into the corresponding code column. When you want to add a function, you can add the function's code into the corresponding code column to prevent existing functions from being deleted.

2.Machine Type: Ordinary and servo machine, it must be selected properly.

3.RPM Holes: Enter the number of actual RPM holes. The charge page will show the screw's rotate speed.

4.You need to enter correct modification code to modify each function and code.

5.System Press Limit: Pressures of all movements are limited by the parameter.

6.Config and PRM backup and recovery: Select Write to copy configuration codes and parameters into a flash disk. Select Read to copy the codes and parameters to another computer. The function can be used to commission same models or replace the host</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>machTbCfg</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：配置

1.机器型号：当面板有机器型号文件存在时，可用于选择相应的机型，并按保存导入相应机型的配置。

2.面板数据是否导入：当有面板数据文件存在时，选机型后可以将面板数据选上，并按保存导入相应面板数据。

注：机器型号文件和面板数据文件都需要PC端工具软件生成。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Machine Config

1.Machine Type:When the panel has the machine model file exists, it can be used to select the appropriate model, and press save import the appropriate model configuration.

2.Include Panel Data: When the panel data file exists, the data can be select on the panel, and press save import the appropriate panel data models after the election.

Note: Machine Model files and panel data files are required to generate the PC utility software.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
