<item type="1">
<value>Other</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：其它

1.粗调模模式：可选择“长动、点动、点动加长动”。

“长动”是指按着调模进、退键就一直输出，松开按键马上停止输出。

“点动”模式时 ，若“调模微调计时”不为0，则这个时间一到就停止输出；若为0时那么“调模微调步数”到就停止输出 。

“点动加长动”是先按点动模式调模，当点动结束后按键未松开就按长动模式继续输出。

任何一种调模模式在调模输出时，4秒钟未检测到调模电眼信号有变化，则警报“调模电眼失败”。

2.调模微调计时：点动模式，调模输出时间。

3.调模微调步数：点动模式，且调模微计时为0，调模电眼脉冲数到达调模微调步数,就停止输出。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Others</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Other_Func</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：其它功能

1. 座退方式：全自动生产时，座台退的方式，可选为“不使用、储料后、开模前、射出后”。 
2. 自动安全门的安装和使用：
2.1 在Code4代码加上80，安全门参数才可选择；

2.2 模式选择：“电动安全门”和“液压安全门” ;

2.3 若IO输出页面没有安全门开、安全门关的输出点还需将两个空余的点重定义为“安全门开、安全门关” ；

2.4 安全门开关按键安装，分别将安全门开、安全门关按钮的一组常开触点焊接到面板背面的接点“OPEN”和“CLOSE” ；

2.5 点动模式：按一下按钮，安全门开、安全门关一直输出至开关门完成，需要在Code0加上4000此模式生效；否则按钮须按住才会持续输出。

3. 安全门开模式：1）开模前：开模开始的同时开安全门，安全门开完成后做托模动作。2）开模后：开模结束后做托模的同时开安全门。

4. 安全门开计时：安全门开保护，在此设定时间内安全门开未完成，停止安全门开输出。设为0时不保护。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Other Function

1. Power Door: When the power door is used, 

1.1 This option must be enabled, 1) Add 128 to Code4, 2) Two spare output points must be defined 96/97 if there is no power door switch output point on the IO page. 3) Install the On and Off buttons of the power door. Weld a group of always-on contacts of the power door’s On and Off buttons on the connection points OPEN and CLOSE on the rear of the panel. 4) Continuous Mode: Press the button and the switch of the power door will receive continuous output before the power door is fully opened or closed. Add 32768 to Code0 to enable the function. Otherwise, you have to press and hold the button to get continuous output. 4) Continuous Mode: Press the button and the switch of the power door will receive continuous output before the power door is fully open or closed. Add 32768 to Code0 to enable the function. Otherwise, press and hold the button to get continuous output. 6) Add 512 to Code3 when a hydraulic pressure power door is used.

2.Power Door Opening Mode: 1) Before clamp opening: The power door opens when the clamp starts opening and ejection is performed after the door is fully open. 2) After clamp opening: Ejection is performed and the door opens concurrently after the clamp is fully open.

Power Door Opening Time: It is used to protect the door. If the door fails to fully open before the time expires, the door opening output will be stopped. Set the value to 0 to disable the function.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语"/>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Other_Param_1</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：其它参数一

一、座台：
1. 斜率：加减速时间，单位为秒(S)；适当设置斜率，可使机器动作连贯柔和，但机器响应会有所变慢。

2. 座台慢速调试压力、流量：调模状态下，做座台进退动作输出的压力、流量。

3. 座台进慢速计时：在全自动的时候，第一模需要座台进，“座进终”或“电子尺位置”到位，使用此时间继续前进，压力、流量使用装模压力、流量。

二、调模：
1. 关模自调模低压计时：自动调模时，首次压模的持续时间 。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文"/>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文"/>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window：Ohter Param 1

Nozzle：
1. Slow Mold ADJ: When you manually adjust the mold, the mold is adjusted in a low speed in the beginning. If the value is 0, the mold is adjusted in a high speed from the beginning.


2. Mold ADJ Count: counting value of the first adjustment in the automatic mold adjustment mode;


3. ADJ Proportion: It is adjusted by 0.01mm. It is set to 5 generally, that means 0.05mm.

</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文"/>
