<item type="1">
<value>Product_Alarm</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：生产自动警报

1.自动警报：选择使用，到F3警报参数里的“自动警报启动模数”后，会自动开启。

2.射出监控：例如设置是+a 、b-，则a、b 表示自动监控允许射出位置偏差值范围。当射出完成时，射出位置与设定位置的差值超出此范围，会警报“射出监控失败“。所以该范围越小，产品良品率越高，但太小容易警报，所以应合理设置此参数。

3.每一个警报计时上限，在启动自动警报时会自动统计生成，不需要人工输入。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">6</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">6</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window：Product Auto Alarm

1.Auto Alarm: It does not need to be enabled. When the "Auto Alarm Number" in F3 is reached, it is enabled automatically.


2.Injection Monitor: If it is set to +a and b-, a and b define the deviation range of the injection position that auto monitoring allows. When injection completes, if the difference between the injection position and preset position exceeds the range, the alarm "Injection Monitoring Failure" will be made. A small range can ensure a low defect rate but also trigger too many alarms. Therefore, you should set a proper range.


3.The up limit of each alarm timer is generated when auto alarm is enabled and does not need to be entered manually.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">6</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">6</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>ProgUpdate</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：程序升级

1.更新面板或主机程序：插入U盘，输入更新代码（面板代码4位，主机代码为12位,每4位一组按顺序填在配置代码、厂商代码、程序代码上）选择更新后，下方进度条会显示更新进度。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">7</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">7</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Program Update

1.Upgrade Panel or Host Program: Insert the flash disk and enter the upgrade code. The panel code has four digits while the host code has 12. The host code comprises Config Code, Factory Code and Program Code, with four digits each. After you start upgrade, the upgrade progress will be shown with a white bar in the bottom.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">7</string>
