<value>Pump_Cfg</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：泵浦配置

1.选中左下方泵浦调整才能进行泵浦配置。

2.配置方法：选中“泵浦调整”，设定每个动作的泵浦配置。对应的小方框设为1，表示进行该动作时此泵输出。每次改变泵浦必须按手动键确认。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">8</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">8</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Pump Config

1.Select Pump ADJ on the left bottom.

2.Config Method: Select “Pump AJD”, configure pumps for each movement. Tick off small boxes to enable output to corresponding pumps during the movement. You need to pressure ENT manually to confirm every pump modification.</string>
