<item type="1">
<value>Servo_Act</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：动作调试

1.缺省P，I值用于油压安全门动作调整，一般每次加减50调整。

2.其它参数为工程参数，客户暂不必调整。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">14</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">14</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Servo Action

1.By default, P and I are used to adjust movements of the core, nozzle and oil-pressure power door by +50 and -50 normally.

2.Others are engineering parameters and do not need to be adjusted.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">14</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">14</string>
