<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Servo_Cfg</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：伺服自学习

1.自学习步骤:（必须关闭马达）

1.1 选择要自学习的驱动编号，选择驱动器参数重置。
1.2 选择电机型号，设定最大转速。
1.3 打开油路上的安全阀，以防自学习时电机正转产生高压油。
1.4 选择动态或者静态，选择开始自学习。
1.5 自学习时弹出警报，自学习不成功，排除故障后重新自学习；自学习成功弹出提示“将控制模式改为EST控制”，确认后转到伺服调试画面。

2.自学习时故障处理：

2.1“ERR43”故障：
a）查看驱动器F1组电机参数 ，F1-01～F1-05分别对应额定功率、额定电压、额定电流、额定频率、额定转速。若不正确，手动更正或面板上重新选择电机型号;
b）检查电机编码器线连接是否紧固.或PG卡是否正常;
c）检查电机油泵是否卡死;

2.2“ERR2/3/4”等过流故障：检查驱动器输入输出是否短路.检查电机三相绕阻和电缆线是否对地短路或相互间短路。

</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">15</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">15</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Servo Cfg

1.Self-learning step: (the motor must be switched off)

1.1 Choose the number of the self-learning drive. Reset parameters of the drive.
1.2 Choose the motor's model number and set the maximum rotate speed.
1.3 Open the safety valve of the oil circuit to prevent high-pressure oil from being generated by forward rotation of the motor during self-learning.
1.4 Select Static or Dynamic and start self-learning.
1.5 If an alarm is prompted during self-learning, the self-learning fails. Re-start self-learning after the problem is solved; After self-learning succeeds, the system will prompt "Control Mode Is Changed to EST Control". After you press ENT, the system will enter serve debugging.

2.Self-learning Troubleshooting:
2.1ERR43:
a）Check motor parameters of the drive in F1 group. F1-100 to F5-05 are motor's power, rated voltage, current, frequency and rotate speed. If any parameter is wrong, manually modify it or re-select the motor model on the panel;
b）check if the motor's encoder is well connected and if the PG card is normal;
c）check if the motor's oil pump is jammed;

2.2“ERR2/3/4” and other over-current fault: Check if the drive's input and output are short-circuit. Check if the motor's three-phase winding and cable are power-to-ground or mutual short-circuit.

</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">15</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">15</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Servo_Curve</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：伺服曲线

1.勾选上相关参数才会有对应的曲线显示。

2.每次只能查看一个伺服泵运行曲线，左则最下方可选择要查看的伺服编号。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">16</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">16</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window：Servo Curve

1.Select related parameters to display corresponding curves.

2.You can only display one servo pump's running curves. Select the model of the servo to be displayed at the left bottom.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">16</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">16</string>
