</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Servo_Help</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：伺服帮助

1.页面左侧可查看：调试须知、调试步骤、如何试压及如何泵浦配置的内容。

2.页面右侧，输入对应的驱动器警报编号，下方自动显示故障内容和排除方法。如驱动器报“ERR10”, 就在此框输入10 。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">17</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">17</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Servo Help

1.The left side of the page shows: commissioning tips and steps, pressure test and pump configuration instructions.

2.You can enter corresponding drive alarm numbers on the right side of the page to display faults and solutions in the bottom. For example, if ERR10 occurs on the drive, enter 10.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">17</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">17</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Servo_State</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：伺服状态

1.此页面可同时观察各个伺服泵的运行状态，尤其方便观察多泵系统的机器每个动作的泵浦配置情况。

2.通讯测试： 
2.1“丢包率%”状态显示橙色，表示丢包过多，检查通讯线连接是否良好。

2.2 显示负值颜色为黑色表示有两台以上驱动编号重复。如通讯正常，进入下一步电机自学习。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">18</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">18</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Servo State

1.You can observe running status of every servo pump on this page. It is very convenient to observe the configuration of pumps during this movement in the multi-pump system.

2.Communication Test: 
2.1When "Packet Loss Rate %" is orange, it indicates that many packets are lost. Check the communication wire.

2.2 If the value is negative and the box is black, two or more drives have the same number. If the communication is sound, IMM will enter the motor parameter self-learning step.

</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">18</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">18</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Servo_Test3</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：伺服调试

1.伺服调试步骤：

1.1 更改控制模式为“EST控制” （多泵系统副泵勿忘更改），然后开启马达。
1.2 通过设定座退压力流量进行测量，下方可查看各种运行参数 。
1.3多泵系统，通过储料动作进行泵浦测试，需注意开启螺杆加热。依次选择各个储料泵浦调试，查看螺杆转速是否正常。
1.4若某个电机转向不对，右上方参数旋转方向改为1。

2.调试时报ERR10”驱动器过载故障处理：

2.1 观察压力是否超出，若超出则检查压力传感器，
2.2 查看电机油泵是否匹配;
2.3 电机油泵是否卡转;
2.4 驱动器型号是否偏小。

3.压力抖动：适当调整右侧参数‘高速增益/低速增益’数值。

4.更多故障处理请查看伺服帮助。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">19</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">19</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Servo Debug

1.Servo debugging steps:

1.1 Change the control mode to “EST Control”. Do not forget to change it on slave pumps in a multi-pump system. Switch the motor on.
1.2 Set the pressure and flow of the nozzle return process. Observe running parameters below.
1.3The multi-pump system is tested through the charging movement. Start screw heating. Commission charging pumps one by one to see if the rotate speed of the screw is normal.
1.4If the rotate direction of a motor is wrong, change the value of the rotate direction on the upper right corner to 1.

2.ERR10 drive overload during commissioning:

2.1 Check the pressure. If it exceeds the normal value, check the pressure sensor;
2.2 check the motor's oil pump matches the motor;
2.3 check if the oil pump is jammed;
2.4 check if the drive is too small.

3.Pressure Vibration: Adjust 'High speed gain/low speed gain' on the right side.

4.See Servo Help for more failure troubleshooting</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">19</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">19</string>
