<item type="1">
<value>Sys_Cfg</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：系统设置

1.画面显示：默认横排，表示每个动作的压力、流量、终止位置等参数的排列。

2. 背景：可选择背景图片。

3.网络：用主ERP软件和IE浏览器浏览或管理面板。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">21</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">21</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：System

1.Display: The layout of parameters such as pressure, flow and end positions can be vertical or horizontal.

2. Appearance: The background color can be changed. Choose a background color, the background color will change; Choose a background image, the background image will change.

3.Network: Use ERP and IE Browser to browse or manage the panel.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">21</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">21</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Sys_Para</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：机器系统参数一

1.马达保护计时：马达在Y转△启动完成后，保护持续时间，即在这个持续时间内不允许电机动作。

2.马达启动计时：马达Y启动的持续时间。

3.马达需要时间：马达Y转△的，中间转换所需时间。

4.马达警报计时：输入点“马达启动完成”未输入，在启动时间超过马达警报计时，报警“马达启动失败”。

5.射出储能压力、流量：在有储能器的时候，射出储能过程中输出的压力.流量。

6.小动作压力上限：座台、托模和中子动作的压力上限。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">22</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">22</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window：System Param 1

1.Motor On Hold Time: It is the protection duration after the motor completes Y-&gt;△ switch. During the period, the motor remains still;

2.Motor Y Start: It is the duration of the motor's Y starting

3.Motor Delta Time: It is the time that the Y-&gt;△ switch process takes;

4.Motor Count: When the number is not 1, output terminals of the motors do not output;

5.Motor On Alarm Time: When the input terminal "Motor On Completes" receives no input within the time, the alarm "Motor On Fails" will be made;

6. Power Match 1-7: It is the proportional valve opening condition in a normal IMM system. The proportional valve only opens when an action's set flow reaches or exceeds the valve's set value.

7.Injection Store Pressure/Flow: It is the pressure and flow output during the injection energy storage process when there is an energy accumulator.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">22</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">22</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Sys_Para_2</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：机器系统参数二

1.液压延时：是指压力、流量经过延时后输出。

2.动作延时：动作结束延时，压力、流量及阀都经过延时后关闭。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">23</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">23</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Machine Para2

1.Hydraulic Delay: Pressure and flow are output after the delay.

2.Action Delay: Pressure, flow and valves are closed after the movement and delay.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">23</string>
