<item type="1">
<value>Temp</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：温度设定

1.加温状态说明：

1.1 空白：无加温；
1.2 +：电热开启且实际温度在PID控制区之外；
1.3 *：电热开启且实际温度在PID控制区之内；
1.4 故障：温度异常；

2.温度显示说明：

2.1 显示999或777，感温线断开或接反。
2.2 设定值不能输入表示该段未使用。

3.保温功能：当保温功能使用时，料筒每段的加热温度就以保温温度设定值为目标温度。

4.首段温度使用百分比加热方式，必须将首段温控缓冲区设为0。

5.预温计时：有效数值范围1到30，其他数值，则下位机默认预温功能不使用。预温功能使用时，下位机检测料筒每段温度是否到达设定值，温度达到后，继续检测此时时间是否大于预温计时，如果预温计时没到而开始做射出、储料或者射退动作，则报警：预温计时未到。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">32</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">32</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Temp

1.Heating status：

1.1 Blank: No heating；
1.2 +: Heating starts and the actual temperature exceeds the PID control range；
1.3 *: Heating starts and the actual temperature is within the PID control range；
1.4 ) Fault: The temperature is abnormal；

2.Temp display：

2.1When 999 or 777 is displayed, the temperature sensor cable is broken or reversely connected.
2.2 When the field cannot be entered, the field is disabled.

3.3.Change "Manual Temp Control Cycle" to "First Section Temp Control Cycle" followed by S as the unit. Change "Manual Heating Percentage" to "Heating Percentage"; use the percentage heating mode to heat the first section. The temperature control buffer of the first section must be set to 0.

4.Heater Warm Time: When each section’s actual temperature reaches the effective temperature, the timer starts. Injection, charging, purging and suck-back can only be performed after the time expires;the effective temperature = preset temperature – 5 centigrade.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">32</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">32</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Temp_Func</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：温度功能

1.定时开启和关闭加温设定：设定起始时间并选择使用，定时加温生效。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">33</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">33</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Temp Function

1.Heating Timer: Set and enable the start time when heating starts.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">33</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">33</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Temp_Param_1</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：温度参数一

1. 缓冲区含义：例：设定温度200 ℃ ，缓冲区设定值为30，则实际加热温度大于等于170 ℃时，关闭电热，进入缓冲加热。

2. 缓冲区设为0 ，关闭相应温度段。

3. 缓冲区&gt;1，缓冲区自动整定加热方式；如：设定温度200℃，缓冲区为30，首次加温实际到达205 ℃，而后开始下降，则缓冲区自动设定为35，如果温度只达到190 ℃，则缓冲区自动设为20。

4. 缓冲区=1，固定缓冲区加热方式；首尾段温度缓冲区将使用参数二内的“温控缓冲区”，中间段缓冲区= 温控缓冲区*2。

5. 温控x段系数，程序内部控制系数，与调整无关。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">34</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">34</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window：Temp Param 1

1. Buffer: For instance, if the preset temperature is 200 centigrade and the buffer is 30, heating will be stopped when the actual temperature is equal to or larger than 170 centigrade.


2. When the buffer is 0, the corresponding temperature section is disabled.


3. When the buffer is larger than 1, the buffer self-tunes the heating mode; For example, the preset value is 200 centigrade and the buffer is 30, the initial actual temperature reaches 205 centigrade and then starts to fall, then the buffer will be set to 35. If the temperature only reaches 190 centigrade, the buffer will be set to 20.


4. If the buffer is 1, the heating mode in the buffer area is fixed; the buffer for the first and last section is the Temp Control Buffer in PAR2 and that for the middle sections is Temp Control Buffer *2;


5. Temperature control x coefficient, internal control coefficient, irrelevant to adjustment</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">34</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">34</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
<item type="1">
<value>Temp_Param_2</value>
<string lang_id="0" lang="中文">窗口名：温度参数二

1.油温高开冷却：
（油箱实际温度≥油温上限-油温高开冷却值时，开启油箱温度冷却器）

2.油温低关冷却：
（油箱实际温度≤油温下限-油温低关冷却值时，关闭油箱温度冷却器）

3.料管冷却开偏差值：料管温度高于（设定温度+此值），冷却风扇开。

4.料管冷却关偏差值：料管温度低于（设定温度-此值），冷却风扇关。

5.电热连续加温不检查：如设定值为0，加热过程中检测到料筒某段的温度在200秒内没有变化，即警报“温度没有上升”；设定值为1，不作检查。</string>
<string lang_id="1" lang="俄文">35</string>
<string lang_id="2" lang="韩文">35</string>
<string lang_id="3" lang="英文">window name：Temp Param 2

1.Cooling On Temp：
IMM starts cooling when the oil temperature exceeds the value.

2.Cooling Off Temp：
IMM stops cooling when the oil temperature is lower than the value.

3.Tube Fan On Difference：The cooling fan is turned on when the difference between the charge tube’s temperature and set temperature is reached.

4.Tube Fan Off Difference: The cooling fan is turned off when the difference between the charge tube’s temperature and set temperature is reached.</string>
<string lang_id="4" lang="阿拉伯文">35</string>
<string lang_id="5" lang="法语"/>
<string lang_id="6" lang="西班牙语">35</string>
<string lang_id="7" lang="土耳其语"/>
<string lang_id="8" lang="波斯文"/>
<string lang_id="9" lang="葡萄牙语"/>
<string lang_id="10" lang="越南文"/>
</item>
